OL,3,GNEWSAMan who stole ambulance with
OL,4,Apatient inside jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA drug user who stole an ambulance with
OL,7,Fan elderly patient and "terrified"
OL,8,Fparamedic inside has been jailed for 21
OL,9,Fmonths.
OL,11,FMarshall Leese, a prolific user of
OL,12,Fmonkey dust, was chased by police for
OL,13,Ftwo miles, going through red light
OL,14,Fsignals, after taking the ambulance
OL,15,Ffrom outside the Royal Stoke University
OL,16,FHospital in Stoke-on-Trent. Had it
OL,17,Fcrashed, the patient would have died,
OL,18,Fthe court heard.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
