OL,3,GNEWSAMan who stole ambulance with
OL,4,Apatient inside jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe stopped at a petrol station on the
OL,7,FA34 in Newcastle-under-Lyme and fled
OL,8,Fthe vehicle but was found hiding nearby
OL,9,Fby a police sniffer dog.
OL,11,FThe 32-year-old appeared at
OL,12,FStoke-on-Trent Crown Court after
OL,13,Fpreviously admitting false imprisonment
OL,14,Fand aggravated vehicle taking following
OL,15,Fthe theft on 25 March.
